WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.460
So, uh welcome to the sofa, m'lady.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:10.590
Uh, Bender, could you please give us a little
privacy?

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.750
I can take a hint!

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.100
But what I can't take is a straightforward request!

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:24.180
And I better not hear anything through the wall!

